      <title>印尼雅加达西部糖果厂发生火灾 造成至少3人遇难数十人失联</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261123-150611&amp;cat=global&amp;event=evt_2d489a8ab069</link>
